# RSI loop — running state is EVIDENCE, not source.
# The append-only stores and receipts grow with every cycle; they are not code and
# not hand-authored, so they stay out of version control. The CODE, config, and
# README are what get sealed. Rebuildable state (capability-graph.json) is derived
# from the SOT at /root/AAA/ops/capabilities/capability-ledger.yaml plus atoms.jsonl.
state/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
